  "description": "<p>This vibrant doormat features colorful artwork inspired by inclusivity, love, and positivity, adding a welcoming touch to your home. Designed for everyday use, it combines a soft surface with a vivid, long-lasting print to enhance your decor. This versatile mat is suitable for various indoor and outdoor spaces, creating an inviting atmosphere.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride rainbow design.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft and comfortable surface.</li>\n<li>Designed for durability with a vivid, long-lasting print.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>Perfect for enhancing modern, boho, retro, or eclectic spaces.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This decorative doormat is ideal for front doors, entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorms, classrooms, offices, and other indoor or outdoor spaces. It helps create a cozy and welcoming atmosphere.</p>",
